FastLED host tests
==================

C++ tests live in three tiers:

  tests/unit/**         Fast doctest suites. Built and run by every `bash test`
                        and `bash test --cpp`. New tests go here.
  tests/integration/**  Heavy doctest suites with real pass/fail. Not built by
                        default; run with `bash test --integration`, or name one:
                        `bash test colorimetric_strategy_table`.
  tests/profile/**      Standalone benchmark binaries; `bash profile <name>`.

A test's name never includes its tier: tests/unit/fl/x/y.cpp is `fl_x_y`.

Everything else at this level is shared by the tiers: test.h, test_pch.h,
doctest_main.cpp, the crash handlers, shared/ (runner), data/ (fixtures),
driver/ (ESP-IDF stub headers) and the Python discovery scripts
(discover_tests.py, organize_tests.py, test_config.py, test_helpers.py).

See agents/tests.md and agents/docs/testing-commands.md.
